{"id":"ffd0dbc00149f28a","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-tableau-window.md","title":"GL Window Witness Lemma","display":"lem-gl-tableau-window — GL Window Witness Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-tableau-window","aliases":["89-lem-gl-tableau-window"],"display":"lem-gl-tableau-window — GL Window Witness Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]","[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-tableau-window"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-tableau-window</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-tableau-window — GL Window Witness Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a> 的定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec D=\\langle D_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec D=\\langle D_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}\\Box D_i\">\\(Q=\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}\\Box D_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\neg C\\land\\Box C\\land\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}(D_i\\land\\Box D_i)\">\\(S=\\neg C\\land\\Box C\\land\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}(D_i\\land\\Box D_i)\\)</span>；空合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}window}\\vdash\n\\bigl((\\neg\\Box C\\land Q)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\neg\\Box C\\land Q\\land\\Diamond S)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}window}\\vdash\n\\bigl((\\neg\\Box C\\land Q)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\neg\\Box C\\land Q\\land\\Diamond S)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.139、143。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>Löb 公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box C\\to C)\\to\\Box C\">\\(\\Box(\\Box C\\to C)\\to\\Box C\\)</span> 的逆否命题给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box C\\to\\Diamond(\\neg C\\land\\Box C)\">\\(\\neg\\Box C\\to\\Diamond(\\neg C\\land\\Box C)\\)</span>。\n模式 4 给出每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D_i\\to\\Box\\Box D_i\">\\(\\Box D_i\\to\\Box\\Box D_i\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bigwedge_i(D_i\\land\\Box D_i)\">\\(\\Box\\bigwedge_i(D_i\\land\\Box D_i)\\)</span>。正规模态逻辑的 K 推导\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box F\\land\\Diamond G\\to\\Diamond(F\\land G)\">\\(\\Box F\\land\\Diamond G\\to\\Diamond(F\\land G)\\)</span>，合并得到所需窗口见证。反向是命题合取消去。</p>\n<p>证明覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span>；此时没有要传播的正盒，仍保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\">\\(\\neg C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span>。额外的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span> 是 GL 终止论证的关键，不能删成 K 的窗口规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-l-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ 是 [[89-df-gl-logic]] 的定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec D=\\langle D_i\\mid i<m\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\bigwedge_{i<m}\\Box D_i","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\neg C\\land\\Box C\\land\\bigwedge_{i<m}(D_i\\land\\Box D_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}window}\\vdash\n\\bigl((\\neg\\Box C\\land Q)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\neg\\Box C\\land Q\\land\\Diamond S)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box C\\to C)\\to\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box C\\to\\Diamond(\\neg C\\land\\Box C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D_i\\to\\Box\\Box D_i","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bigwedge_i(D_i\\land\\Box D_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box F\\land\\Diamond G\\to\\Diamond(F\\land G)","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false}],"bytes":1605,"backlinks":[{"id":"b271bf5e7002b205","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","e2ade50b86346886","0e77586c4dc7e03a","ca21b68a25f1afc2"]}